ADDITIONAL NOTICE — EDUCATIONAL USE ONLY

This project intentionally creates vulnerable systems for security education and
practice. It is designed to run on an ISOLATED, host-only virtual network with
no exposure to the public internet or any production environment. You are
responsible for using it only on infrastructure you own or are explicitly
